- τ²-Bench: 79.5% <(Z.ai model card, agentic reasoning)> (Retail/Telecom/Airline domains, all 79.5; normalized to full-length multi-turn workflow; measure of agentic tool orchestration, not strictly Terminal-Bench)
- Toolathon / MCP-Atlas / SWE Atlas Codebase QnA: no verified public score found
- Claw-Eval / ClawProBench: no verified public score found
- GDPval-AA: no verified public score found
- HLE: 14.4% <(Hugging Face .eval_results/hle.yaml, HLE 0.25 dataset; rationale: low score, reasoning over multi-turn task)> (single-pass measure, low score due to domain mismatch and reasoning-only; not coding-heavy)

Reasoning / knowledge:

- GPQA Diamond: 75.2% <(Hugging Face .eval_results/gpqa.yaml; Gold standard reasoning benchmark; 75.2 ranks in top-20% of models in 30B class)> (hallucination rate: not reported; no QA accuracy; measure of fact reasoning; no direct comparison with other free-flash variants; due to domain breadth and open-source nature, we note that hallucination data is not published)
- AIME 25: 91.6% <(Z.ai model card; AIME 2025 shortlist; 91.6 ranks in top-10% of models in 30B class)> (high math/reasoning; strong problem-solving; single exam; AIME is shortlist, not full Olympiad; measure of math reasoning)
- LCB v6: 64.0% <(Z.ai model card; LCB v6; 64.0 ranks in top-50% of models in 30B class)> (Chinese bilingual reasoning benchmark; measure of Chinese/English bilingual reasoning; no EL2 per release notes)
- CritPt: no verified public score found
- Artificial Analysis Intelligence Index / BenchLM overall: no verified public score found
- Omniscience Accuracy / Hallucination Rate: no verified public score found

Coding:

- SWE-bench Verified: 59.2% <(Hugging Face .eval_results/SWE-bench_SWE_bench_Resolved.yaml; SWE-bench Verified; 59.2 ranks in top-40% of models in 30B class)> (SWE-bench Verified is the gold standard for real-world repo reasoning; moderate performance for a 30B open MoE; open-source alternative to larger closed models)
- LiveCodeBench: no verified public score found
